1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,300
A flywheel with missing parts doesn't spin.
It wobbles.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,600
Most revenue teams run with gaps
they've stopped seeing.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,600
Some parts are missing altogether.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,800
Others exist in name only.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:14,450
So look at your own.
Which parts are missing?

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,700
Which ones only exist on paper?

7
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:19,600
And there's one segment almost nobody draws.

8
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:23,900
Contract value. Revenue you've
already earned, and never billed.

9
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,200
Which would you fix first?
Tell me in the comments.
